    <string-array name="eye_tips">
        <item>Look at something at least 6 metres (20 feet) away for 20 seconds.</item>
        <item>Blink slowly 10 times to refresh and moisten your eyes.</item>
        <item>Close your eyes and relax your face, jaw and shoulders.</item>
        <item>Roll your eyes slowly: up, right, down, left — then the other way.</item>
        <item>Rub your palms until warm and cup them gently over your closed eyes.</item>
        <item>Look out of a window and focus on the farthest point you can see.</item>
        <item>Focus on your finger close to your face, then on something far away. Repeat 5 times.</item>
        <item>Stand up, stretch your back and neck, and drink a glass of water.</item>
    </string-array>
